 <P COM="0546">Ans. lib. V. cap. 1, 2 et 3.—C. 24, q. 1, c. 18,
19, 20; lib. V, c. 4, 5, 6, 12, 16, 1 <LACUNA></LACUNA>  21, 22, 23.—D.
 <COL N="0547C"></COL> 1,  <HI REND="ITALIC">De cons.,</HI>  c. 6, 5, 7, 19, 36, 38, 21, 22, 16.
Lib. V, c. 59, 60, 61.—C. 18, q. 2, c. 25, 26, 27;
 <COL N="0547D"></COL> lib. V, c. 72, 73, 74, 75.—C. 16, q. 7, c. 40, 36,
35, 33.</P> 

 <P COM="0547">Ans. lib. VI, cap. 27, 28, 29, 30, 31.—D. 79,
