 <P COM="0547">Ans. lib. VII, cap. 2-8.—C. 12, q. 1, c. 5, 8, 9,
3, 10, 11, 14, 1. Lib. VII, c. 18-20, 21-23, 32-34.—D.
50, c. 60, 56, 58.—D. 98, c. 1-3.—D. 55, c. 6,
7, 12. Lib. VII, c. 38-40.—D. 75, c. 3, 4, 7. Lib. VII,
c. 48-55.—D. 33, c. 20, 19, 18, 17, 16, 15, 11, 7.
Lib. VII, c. 56-58, 66 et 67, 108-110, 114 et 115.—D.
93, c. 13-15.—D. 92, c. 1 et 2.—D. 38,
c. 3 5.—D. 68, c. 4 et 5.</P> 

 <P COM="0547">Ans. lib. VII, c. 140-142.—D. 81, c. 20, 21, 30,
 <COL N="0548C"></COL> 31.—Lib. VII, c. 185, 186.—C. 18, q. 2, c. 19
et 20.</P> 

 <P COM="0548"><COL N="0548D"></COL> Ans. lib. IX, cap. 22, 23, 25.—D. 5,  <HI REND="ITALIC">De cons.</HI> 
c. 1, 2 et 3.</P> 

 <P COM="0548">Ans. lib. X, cap. 7-9, 18-20.—C. 27, q. 2, c. 30,
46, 49, 19, 21, 22.—Lib. X, c. 27, 28.—C. 30,
q. 3, c. 1 et 2.</P> 

 <P COM="0548">Ans. lib. XI, cap. 51-54, 130 et 140.—C. 22,
q. 5, c. 1-4,—D. 1,  <HI REND="ITALIC">De poenit.,</HI>  c. 81 et 82.</P> 

 <P COM="0548">Ans. lib. XII, cap. 13, 14, 16, 18, 25-27, 32-34, 36.—C.
11, q. 3, c. 16 19, 27, 6, 9, 20, 3-5. Lib. XII,
c. 41, 42, 44, 48, 52.—C. 24, q. 1, c. 31, 33, 34,
23, 30. Lib. XII, c. 45-47, 49-50, 53, 54-56, 64 et
